  "text": {
    "gauge_intro": [
      "October’s sales-to-active listings ratio was 13.4%, in the lower half of the balanced range. Detached homes, at 11.6%, were just under the 12% level usually linked to downward price pressure, while attached homes were the firmest at 16.5%.",
      "10 月销售与在售房源比率为 13.4%，处于供需平衡区间的偏低一侧。独立屋为 11.6%，略低于通常对应价格下行压力的 12%；联排及半独立住宅最为坚挺，为 16.5%。"
    ],
    "rent_notes": [
      [
        "Among the Canadian cities liv.rent tracks, West Vancouver ($2,532), North Vancouver ($2,452) and Vancouver ($2,329) have the highest one-bedroom asking rents.",
        "在 liv.rent 追踪的加拿大城市中，一居室挂牌租金最高的是西温哥华（$2,532）、北温哥华（$2,452）和温哥华（$2,329）。"
      ],
      [
        "Year over year, one-bedroom asking rents fell in all nine cities in the report, from −2.6% in Vancouver to −16.6% in Richmond.",
        "与去年同期相比，报告所列九个城市的一居室挂牌租金全部下降，从温哥华的 −2.6% 到列治文的 −16.6%。"
      ],
      [
        "Month over month, one-bedroom asking rents rose in West Vancouver (+2.73%) and Coquitlam (+1.10%) and fell in Richmond (−2.64%) and Burnaby (−2.26%).",
        "与上月相比，西温哥华（+2.73%）和高贵林（+1.10%）的一居室挂牌租金上升，列治文（−2.64%）和本拿比（−2.26%）下降。"
      ],
      [
        "In Vancouver, the highest one-bedroom asking rent was in West Point Grey/UBC ($2,600) and the lowest in Sunset–Victoria Fraserview ($1,717). Kitsilano was $2,534 and Downtown $2,496.",
        "在温哥华，一居室挂牌租金最高的是 West Point Grey/UBC（$2,600），最低的是 Sunset–Victoria Fraserview（$1,717）；基斯兰奴为 $2,534，市中心为 $2,496。"
      ]
    ],
    "take": [
      [
        "October was quiet on both sides. Sales fell 10.2% from a year ago and new listings fell 11.6%, so buyers and sellers both held back. Active listings are 4.3% below last October but still 24% above the 10-year seasonal average, so buyers have more choice than in a typical October.",
        "10 月买卖双方都比较观望。成交量较去年同期下降 10.2%，新增房源下降 11.6%。在售房源较去年 10 月减少 4.3%，但仍比十年季节性平均高 24%，因此买家的选择比往年同期更多。"
      ],
      [
        "With a sales-to-active ratio of 13.4%, the market sits at the lower end of balanced. Detached homes are just under the 12% mark, where conditions favour buyers most; attached homes are the firmest at 16.5%.",
        "销售与在售房源比率为 13.4%，市场处于供需平衡的偏低一侧。独立屋略低于 12%，是对买家最有利的类别；联排及半独立住宅最为坚挺，为 16.5%。"
      ],
      [
        "Benchmark prices are 5.2% lower than a year ago, with detached homes down 7.0%, attached homes down 5.5% and apartments down 5.9%. On the rental side, one-bedroom asking rents across Metro Vancouver are down 6.3% from a year ago, while Vancouver two-bedrooms are up 5.2%.",
        "基准价格较去年同期下降 5.2%，其中独立屋下降 7.0%，联排及半独立住宅下降 5.5%，公寓下降 5.9%。租金方面，大温哥华一居室挂牌租金较去年同期下降 6.3%，而温哥华两居室上涨 5.2%。"
      ],
      [
        "If you’re thinking of buying or selling, send us your address or the area you’re watching and we’ll walk you through what this means for your own situation.",
